  "releaseNotes": "## 12.2.0\n\n### Features\n- A `<ul>`/`<ol>` `style=\"padding-left\"` and `\"margin-left\"` are now read onto the list's padding (the content indent, where the marker column lives) and margin, matching the CSS list box where the marker sits in the padding. The indent lands on the `List`, shared by every item, not copied onto each `<li>`. Lists with no explicit indent keep the computed column as before.",
